P10：本机 QEMU 3.1.50 -audio-help 实测输出（驱动能力一手证据）
日期: 2026-11-11; 命令: Qemu\qemu-system-i386w.exe --version; Qemu\qemu-system-i386w.exe -audio-help
采集方式: cmd 重定向到临时文件后逐行读取（PowerShell 直接 & 调用拿不到该程序的标准输出）

== 版本 ==
QEMU emulator version 3.1.50 (v3.1.0-13607-geb2db0f7ba-dirty)

== 可用驱动（逐字）==
  Name: none
    Description: Timer based audio emulation
    Theoretically supports many playback voices
    Theoretically supports many capture voices
    No options
  Name: wav
    Description: WAV renderer http://wikipedia.org/wiki/WAV
    One playback voice
    Does not support capture
    Options:
  Name: dsound
    Description: DirectSound http://wikipedia.org/wiki/DirectSound
    Theoretically supports many playback voices
    One capture voice
    Options:
    Options are settable through environment variables.

== 结论 ==
1. 本机构建有 3 个驱动：none / wav / dsound（无 sdl、pa、alsa）。
2. none: Theoretically supports many capture voices -> 采集可用（P10 前提）。
3. wav: Does not support capture -> wav 后端只能录播放侧，不能做采集回归。
4. dsound: One capture voice，但要碰宿主默认音频设备（违反 D9）。
=> 同时满足「不动宿主声卡（D9）」+「采集链路可跑」的只有 none。
